---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="IAM Consulting | Blooming Systems Inc."
  description="Blooming Systems Inc. provides identity and access management consulting to help organizations assess, design, modernize, and optimize enterprise identity environments."
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">IDENTITY & ACCESS MANAGEMENT</p>

        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div>
            <h1>
              Build an identity
              <span>foundation that scales.</span>
            </h1>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-copy">
            <p>
              Identity sits at the intersection of security, access,
              technology, and business operations. We help organizations
              assess their current identity environment, define a practical
              target architecture, and establish a roadmap for modernization.
            </p>

            <a href="/contact/" class="button">
              Talk to us <span>↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro-section">
      <div class="container split">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">THE IDENTITY FOUNDATION</p>
          <h2>Identity is more than authentication.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            Modern organizations operate across cloud platforms, SaaS
            applications, on-premises infrastructure, directories, data
            platforms, and legacy systems.
          </p>

          <p>
            Users and machines need the right access across that environment
            at the right time and under the right controls.
          </p>

          <p>
            We help organizations bring structure to that complexity through
            practical identity architecture and modernization strategies.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="capabilities">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">CONSULTING CAPABILITIES</p>
          <h2>From identity strategy <span>to architecture.</span></h2>
        </div>

        <div class="capability-grid">
          <article>
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>IAM Strategy & Roadmap</h3>
            <p>
              Define an identity strategy aligned with business requirements,
              security objectives, technology direction, and organizational
              priorities.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Identity Architecture</h3>
            <p>
              Assess the existing environment and design an architecture
              connecting identity providers, directories, applications,
              governance platforms, and access controls.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Platform Assessment</h3>
            <p>
              Evaluate identity platforms, integrations, configurations, and
              operating models to identify gaps, dependencies, and
              opportunities for improvement.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>04</span>
            <h3>Identity Modernization</h3>
            <p>
              Develop practical modernization paths from legacy directory and
              authentication environments toward modern cloud and hybrid
              identity architectures.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>05</span>
            <h3>Governance Alignment</h3>
            <p>
              Connect identity architecture with access requests, entitlement
              management, lifecycle processes, access reviews, and governance
              controls.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>06</span>
            <h3>Operating Model</h3>
            <p>
              Define the processes, responsibilities, controls, and operating
              practices required to manage identity as an enterprise
              capability.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="approach">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK</p>
        <h2>Understand the environment. Define the direction. Build the path forward.</h2>

        <div class="steps">
          <article><strong>01</strong><h3>Assess</h3><p>Understand the current identity landscape, platforms, applications, integrations, lifecycle processes, and dependencies.</p></article>
          <article><strong>02</strong><h3>Design</h3><p>Define the target identity architecture and relationships between authentication, authorization, governance, directories, and applications.</p></article>
          <article><strong>03</strong><h3>Prioritize</h3><p>Identify initiatives and dependencies that provide a practical path toward the target state.</p></article>
          <article><strong>04</strong><h3>Implement</h3><p>Translate architecture into practical implementation across platforms, integrations, workflows, and identity processes.</p></article>
          <article><strong>05</strong><h3>Optimize</h3><p>Address operational gaps and evolve the identity architecture as requirements change.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="domains">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">IDENTITY DOMAINS</p>
        <h2>Connect the pieces of the identity ecosystem.</h2>

        <div class="domain-grid">
          <article><h3>Workforce Identity</h3><p>Identity and access for employees, contractors, and workforce populations.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Customer Identity</h3><p>Identity experiences and access models for customers, partners, and external users.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Privileged Access</h3><p>Stronger controls around administrative identities and elevated access.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Identity Governance</h3><p>Lifecycle management, access requests, entitlement governance, certification, and policy controls.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Hybrid Identity</h3><p>Connecting cloud identity services with on-premises directories, applications, and legacy environments.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">READY TO MOVE YOUR IDENTITY STRATEGY FORWARD?</p>
        <h2>Let's build the next stage of your <span>identity environment.</span></h2>
        <a href="/contact/" class="button">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page { color: var(--color-text); }
  .container { width: min(var(--container), calc(100% - (var(--gutter) * 2))); margin: 0 auto; }
  .eyebrow { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin:0 0 24px; color:var(--color-blue); font-size:15px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label); }
  .eyebrow::before { content:""; width:28px; height:1px; background:var(--color-blue); }
  .service-hero { padding:180px 0 130px; background:#eef4ff; border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .hero-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; gap:100px; align-items:end; }
  h1 { margin:0; color:var(--color-ink); font-size:clamp(52px,6vw,88px); line-height:.98; letter-spacing:-.055em; font-weight:650; }
  h1 span,h2 span { display:block; color:var(--color-blue); }
  .hero-copy { max-width:500px; font-size:17px; line-height:1.75; }
  .button { display:inline-flex; gap:14px; align-items:center; margin-top:28px; padding:0 24px; min-height:52px; background:var(--color-blue); color:white; text-decoration:none; font-size:var(--text-sm); font-weight:650; }
  .intro-section,.capabilities,.approach,.domains,.cta { padding:120px 0; }
  .split { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr; gap:100px; }
  h2 { margin:0; color:var(--color-ink); font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,62px); line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-.04em; font-weight:650; }
  .prose { max-width:700px; font-size:17px; line-height:1.8; }
  .prose p { margin:0 0 24px; }
  .capabilities { background:var(--color-ink); color:white; }
  .capabilities h2 { color:white; }
  .capability-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1px; margin-top:70px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.15); }
  .capability-grid article { padding:38px; min-height:260px; background:var(--color-ink); }
  .capability-grid span { color:var(--color-white); font-size:40px; font-weight:700; }
  .capability-grid h3 { margin:38px 0 15px; color:white; font-size:22px; }
  .capability-grid p { margin:0; color:rgba(255,255,255,.68); line-height:1.7; font-size:14px; }
  .approach { border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .approach > .container > h2 { max-width:900px; }
  .steps { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr); gap:18px; margin-top:65px; }
  .steps article { padding:30px; background:var(--color-surface); border:1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .steps strong { color:var(--color-blue); font-size:40px; }
  .steps h3 { color:var(--color-ink); margin:45px 0 14px; }
  .steps p,.domain-grid p { margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; }
  .domains { background:#eef4ff; }
  .domain-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr); gap:1px; margin-top:60px; background:var(--color-border); }
  .domain-grid article { padding:32px; background:white; }
  .domain-grid h3 { margin:0 0 18px; color:var(--color-ink); }
  .cta { background:var(--color-white); border-top:1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .cta h2 { max-width:900px; }
  @media(max-width:1000px) {
    .hero-grid,.split { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:45px; }
    .capability-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
    .steps { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
    .domain-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
  }
  @media(max-width:640px) {
    .service-hero { padding:130px 0 90px; }
    .intro-section,.capabilities,.approach,.domains,.cta { padding:85px 0; }
    .capability-grid,.steps,.domain-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    h1 { font-size:clamp(46px,13vw,65px); }
  }
</style>